  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://orion.local/resource/resultingontologyshouldrepresent">
    <rdfs:label>ResultingOntologyShouldRepresent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The resulting ontology should represent that users access systems, roles include permissions, controls reduce risks, threats exploit vulnerabilities, incidents affect assets, systems process information assets, policies define requirements, requirements are satisfied by controls, suppliers provide services, and auditors evaluate compliance.</rdfs:comment>
